    {
      "source": "<code>element</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>element</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 4
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> built by the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionBuilder</code></a> enriched with source\ninformation derived from the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回由给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionBuilder</code></a> 构建并附加了源自给定 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a> 的源信息的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a> for an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ObjectFactoryCreatingFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ObjectFactoryCreatingFactoryBean</code></a> pointing to the bean with the\ngiven name.",
      "translation": "返回一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/BeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>BeanDefinition</code></a>，该定义指向一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/config/ObjectFactoryCreatingFactoryBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.config\"><code>ObjectFactoryCreatingFactoryBean</code></a>，该工厂指向给定名称的 Bean。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/AbstractBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>AbstractBeanDefinition</code></a> built by the given builder with the given extracted source applied.",
      "translation": "返回由给定构建器构建并应用给定提取源的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/AbstractBeanDefinition.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory.support 中的类或接口\"><code>AbstractBeanDefinition</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Sets the property with the given attribute name on the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionBuilder</code></a> to the value of the\nattribute with the given name if the attribute is configured.",
      "translation": "在指定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/support/BeanDefinitionBuilder.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.support\"><code>BeanDefinitionBuilder</code></a> 上设置具有给定属性名的属性，如果该属性已配置，则将其设置为具有给定名称的属性的值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures a property value for the given property name reading the attribute of the given name from the given\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a> if the attribute is configured.",
      "translation": "为给定的属性名称配置属性值；如果已配置该属性，则从给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.xml/org/w3c/dom/Element.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.w3c.dom\"><code>Element</code></a>中读取具有该名称的属性。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Configures a bean property reference with the value of the attribute of the given name if it is configured.",
      "translation": "如果已配置，则使用给定名称的属性值来配置 Bean 属性引用。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>attribute</code> - must not be null or empty.",
      "translation": "<code>attribute</code> 不能为 null 或空。",
      "count": 2
