      "translation": "适用于 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/xml/BeanDefinitionParser.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.xml\"><code>BeanDefinitionParser</code></a> 实现的工具方法。",
